# No required environment variables.
#
# The portfolio is static: it builds and runs with this file empty. The optional
# deploy overrides `SITE_URL` and `SITE_BASE` are read by `astro.config.mjs`, and
# the analytics configuration by `src/lib/analytics.ts`; both are set in the
# platform settings (GitHub Pages / Vercel) rather than committed here.
#
# See `docs/guides/getting-started.md`.
